"title":"A kid dancing with a balloon","illustrator":"Ekta Bharti","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":6,"title":"A man selling ice gola","illustrator":"Ekta Bharti","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":7,"title":"A hand holding a gola popsicle","illustrator":"Ekta Bharti","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":8,"title":"A boy laughing at a red gola popsicle","illustrator":"Ekta Bharti","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":9,"title":"A lady pointing at a flying kite","illustrator":"Ekta Bharti","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":10,"title":"Two hands pointing at a kite","illustrator":"Ekta Bharti","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":11,"title":"An old lady laughing at a blue kite","illustrator":"Ekta Bharti","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":12,"title":"Colourful Chashmas","illustrator":"Ekta Bharti","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/441227-daadi-daadi-idu-yaava-banna/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["“ತಗೊಳ್ಳಿ ತಗೊಳ್ಳಿ ಬಣ್ಣ-ಬಣ್ಣದ ಮತ್ತು ಹೊಳೆವ ಕನ್ನಡಕ.","ಹಾಕಿಕೊಂಡರೆ ಕಾಣುವುದು ನಿಮಗೆ ಬೇರೆ ಲೋಕ.”","“ಬಾ ದಾದಿ, ಊಹಿಸುವ ಆಟ ಆಡೋಣ. ನಾವು ಒಂದು ಬಣ್ಣವನ್ನು ತೋರಿಸುತ್ತೇವೆ, ನೀನು ಅದರ ಹೆಸರು ಹೇಳಬೇಕು.”"]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/441227-daadi-daadi-idu-yaava-banna/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಆಟ ಶುರು ಮಾಡೋಣ. ಬೇಗ ಬಾ ದಾದಿ!”","“ಇದು ಯಾವ ಬಣ್ಣದ ಬಲೂನು?”"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/441227-daadi-daadi-idu-yaava-banna/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಅದೇನು ಮಹಾ, ಹಸಿರುಬಣ್ಣದ ಬಲೂನು.”"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/441227-daadi-daadi-idu-yaava-banna/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಅಲ್ಲ, ದಾದಿ... ಬೇರೆ ಬಣ್ಣ!","ಇದು ಗಾಢ ನೀಲಿ.”"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/441227-daadi-daadi-idu-yaava-banna/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಆಯ್ತು ದಾದಿ, ಇಲ್ಲಿ ಬಾ... ಈ ಗೋಲಾದ ಬಣ್ಣ ಯಾವುದು?”"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/441227-daadi-daadi-idu-yaava-banna/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಅದೇನು ಮಹಾ, ಕಿತ್ತಳೆಬಣ್ಣದ ಗೋಲಾ.”"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/441227-daadi-daadi-idu-yaava-banna/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಅಲ್ಲ, ದಾದಿ... ಬೇರೆ ಬಣ್ಣ.","ಇದು ಉರಿಯ ಕೆಂಪುಬಣ್ಣದ ಗೋಲಾ.”"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/441227-daadi-daadi-idu-yaava-banna/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಏಯ್ ಗುಡ್ಡು, ಗೋಲು ಇಲ್ಲಿ ಬನ್ನಿ.","ಈಗ ನಿಮ್ಮ ಸರದಿ.","ಅಲ್ಲಿ ಹಾರುತ್ತಿರುವ ಗಾಳಿಪಟದ ಬಣ್ಣ ಯಾವುದು?”"]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/441227-daadi-daadi-idu-yaava-banna/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಅದೇನು ಮಹಾ, ನೇರಳೆಬಣ್ಣದ ಗಾಳಿಪಟ ದಾದಿ.”"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/441227-daadi-daadi-idu-yaava-banna/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["“ಅಲ್ಲ, ಮಕ್ಕಳೇ... ಬೇರೆ ಬಣ್ಣ.","ಗಾಢ ನೀಲಿಬಣ್ಣದ ಗಾಳಿಪಟ. ಕಾಣ್ತಿಲ್ಲವೇ?\""]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/441227-daadi-daadi-idu-yaava-banna/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ದಾದಿ, ಗುಡ್ಡು ಮತ್ತು ಗೋಲುಗೆ ಇಷ್ಟು ಬಣ್ಣಗಳು ಹೇಗೆ ಕಂಡವು?","ಈ ಪ್ರಯೋಗ ಮಾಡಿ ನೋಡಿ","ಕೆಂಪು + ನೀಲಿ = ನೇರಳೆ","ನೀಲಿ + ಹಳದಿ = ಹಸಿರು","ಕೆಂಪು + ಹಳದಿ = ಕಿತ್ತಳೆ"]}],"wordCount":118}